<title>USA: Fed says 5-day system RPs totaled $3.539 billion.</title>
<headline>Fed says 5-day system RPs totaled $3.539 billion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it added $3.539 billion to the banking system via five-day system repurchase agreements on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
